{"audit_findings": "```json
{
  "analysis_summary": "This ontology demonstrates a reasonable understanding of EDIFACT's hierarchical structure but suffers from critical incompleteness for D96A EANCOM INVOIC. Only 2 segment types (BGM, NAD) are explicitly modeled out of the ~15-20 required. The ontology lacks qualifier distinctions entirely, making it impossible to differentiate NAD+BY from NAD+SU or DTM+137 from DTM+35. Cardinality constraints are present but not validated against EANCOM business rules.",
  "completeness_score": 0.15,
  "extensions_required": [
    {
      "type": "class",
      "name": "DTMSegment (with qualifier subclasses)",
      "priority": "high",
      "rationale": "D96A INVOIC mandates Document Date (DTM+137) as MANDATORY. The ontology has no date representation. Must create DTMSegment with subclasses for DTM137_DocumentDate, DTM35_DeliveryDate, DTM11_Despatch", "owl_reviewed_length": 17949, "consultation_logged": true, "audits_remaining": 0}

